# Chalk Outline ({3}{G}): "Whenever one or more creature cards leave your graveyard". Turn 1: Black Lotus (RRR) and Mox Emerald pay it,
# Mox Ruby pays a Ghost Vacuum. Turn 2: Bot2's Faithless Looting discards a Wall of Stone and an Island; in Bot2's second main the
# Vacuum exiles the Wall of Stone from BOT2's graveyard - a creature card, but not leaving Bot1's: no Detective. Turn 3: Bot1's own
# Looting discards Hero of Bladehold and Llanowar Elves; the Vacuum exiles Faithless Looting from Bot1's graveyard - a card leaving
# Bot1's graveyard, but not a creature card: no Detective. Turn 5: it exiles Hero of Bladehold - a creature card leaving Bot1's
# graveyard: a 2/2 white and blue Detective, then a Clue. CR 603.10a, 111.1, 701.16a.

